* GENSUB 2 2.5 on the 3D brick seed: object 2's KEY block has ECCTMP count 36 > 27 elements -> converter error, DEF_CTRL.OUT '\tERROR : ECCTMP could not be read', no MESH.DAT, AX_BIL.KEY left (open handle); DEF_SUB.INI = '2 64 27' / '1 4 2.5'; status 0 (corrected after oracle run)
